  <ns0:Document>
    <ns0:name>Bank Erosion Hotspots 2016-2026</ns0:name>
    <ns0:description>Bank erosion hotspots · Landsat 8/9 · MNDWI
Period: 2016–2026 (2026 through Aug 20)
Analysis area: 312.24 ha
Light-green = No Erosion (water corridor only)
Hotspot = number of year-to-year periods with detected erosion

BANK EROSION HOTSPOT
#90EE90  0 = No / Very Low Erosion (0)
#FFFF00  1 = Low Erosion (1-2)
#FFA500  2 = Moderate Erosion (3-4)
#FF0000  3 = High Erosion (5-7)
#800000  4 = Very High Erosion (8+)</ns0:description>
